.TH BIOSEQ.FASTA 4 2000-1月 "read.fasta" "read.fasta"
.SH NAME
read.fasta \- read a fasta sequence collection file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIread.fasta(\fBfile\fR as string, 
\fBlazyStream\fR as boolean = FALSE);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
read a fasta sequence collection file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the fasta sequence file for read the sequence data.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBlazyStream\fB \fR\- 
 read the fasta sequence data in a lazy stream mode? if this parameter is 
 TRUE, then a pipeline object of the @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.SequenceModel.FASTA.FastaSeq\fR sequence data 
 will be returned, which is helpful for read a huge fasta sequence file 
 without loading all of the sequence data into the memory at once.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
A collection of the fasta sequence object: a vector of the 
 @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.SequenceModel.FASTA.FastaSeq\fR object that contains all of the sequence data in 
 the given fasta file, or a lazy pipeline object of the 
 @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.SequenceModel.FASTA.FastaSeq\fR sequence data when the \fBlazyStream\fR parameter is 
 TRUE.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
bioseq.fasta
.SH FILES
.PP
seqtoolkit.dll
.PP
